{icon:Marker_Helltide_Chest, 2}{c_white}Rewards{/c} - Vanquish the Undercity to earn Obols, doubled while {c_rare}Purified{/c}.

{icon:DivinePower_Purified, 2}{if:SF_1}{c_gray}{/if} {c_rare}Purified{/c} - Gain {c_number}[{SF_9}*100|%|]{/c} Movement Speed.{if:SF_1}{/c}{/if}

{icon:DivinePower_Corrupted, 2}{if:SF_2}{c_gray}{/if} {c_lore}Corrupted{/c} - Manifestations of Anguish lurk throughout the Undercity and attach lightning siphons to you that Slow you by {c_number}[{SF_4}|%|]{/c} while you are close to them.{if:SF_2}{/c}{/if}
